tn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056760/extras/eb41e15ebd45f1f7218af60917ea6132.poster.avif?t=1750518668\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056760/extras/eb41e15ebd45f1f7218af60917ea6132.webm?t=1750518668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056760/extras/eb41e15ebd45f1f7218af60917ea6132.mp4?t=1750518668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Observe, Plan, and Execute</strong><br>Slow down and think. Every situation you find yourself in has more than one solution.",
